cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "vue-legal-ml-builder"
abstract: >-
  vue-legal-ml-builder is a Vue 3 component library providing the user
  interface of the Legal Blocks / BAIGLE no-code machine learning workbench
  for legal text: dataset management and exploratory data analysis, a guided
  model-creation wizard, training with live experiment monitoring,
  prediction and LIME/SHAP explanation views, visualization, and annotation.
  Components never call an API directly; a single host-supplied adapter is
  the entire backend contract, and the reference backend is legal-ml-core.
  It is designed for teaching legal professionals and students machine
  learning without writing code.
